  function editor(){const s=slides[activeSlide];return `<div class="cw-editor"><aside class="cw-panel cw-thumb-panel"><div class="cw-thumb-head"><h3>页面导航</h3><button class="icon-btn" onclick="cwAddSlide()">＋</button></div><div class="cw-muted" style="margin-top:4px">第 2 章 · ${slides.length} / 91 页</div><div class="cw-thumb-list">${slides.map((x,i)=>`<div class="cw-thumb ${i===activeSlide?'active':''}" onclick="cwSlide(${i})"><div class="thumb-top"><span class="thumb-type">${x[2]}</span><span class="cw-muted">${x[0]}</span></div><small>${x[1]}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><button class="btn secondary" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px" onclick="cwAddSlide()">＋ 新增页面</button></aside><section class="cw-panel cw-canvas-panel"><div class="cw-editor-toolbar"><div><b>第 ${s[0]} 页 · ${s[1]}</b><div class="cw-muted">${s[3]}</div></div><div class="cw-toolbar-actions"><select class="cw-select" onchange="cwLayout(this.value)"><option>内容页</option><option>图示页</option><option>例题页</option><option>互动页</option></select><button class="btn secondary" onclick="cwRegenerate()">重新生成</button></div></div><div class="cw-slide"><span class="cw-slide-kicker">CHAPTER 02 · GRAPH THEORY</span><h2>${s[1]}</h2><ul class="cw-bullets"><li>掌握图的基本概念、结点集与边集的表示方法</li><li>理解邻接矩阵与关联矩阵，并能完成简单转换</li><li>结合城市交通网络案例，解释图模型的应用价值</li></ul>${activeSlide===2?'<div class="cw-diagram"><strong>页面内图表组件 · 图的定义</strong>V = {v₁, v₂, …, vₙ}　 E = {e₁, e₂, …, eₘ}<br>建议使用“结点—边”关系图表达</div>':''}</div><div class="cw-edit-fields"><label><span class="cw-field-label">页面标题</span><input class="cw-input" value="${s[1]}" onchange="cwEditTitle(this.value)"></label><label><span class="cw-field-label">页面要点</span><textarea class="cw-textarea">掌握图的基本概念、结点集与边集的表示方法\n理解邻接矩阵与关联矩阵，并能完成简单转换\n结合城市交通网络案例，解释图模型的应用价值</textarea></label></div></section><aside class="cw-rail"><section class="cw-panel"><h3>来源与教学关联</h3><div class="cw-source"><div class="cw-source-card"><b>离散数学教材.pdf</b><small>第 4 章 · 图论基础 · 第 4–8 页</small><button class="btn secondary" style="margin-top:7px" onclick="cwSource()">查看原文</button></div><div class="cw-source-card"><b>第 2 章章节备课</b><small>重点难点 · 例题与互动 · 已确认</small></div><div class="cw-source-card"><b>知识点 / 目标</b><small>图的定义 · 目标 2 · 能力指标 A1</small></div></div></section><section class="cw-panel cw-ai"><h3>AI 建议 <span class="cw-chip" style="float:right">2 条</span></h3><div class="cw-ai-item"><b>建议插入图表</b><p>将结点集与边集改为关系图，有助于降低定义理解成本。</p><div class="cw-ai-actions"><button class="btn primary" onclick="cwApply('图表已插入当前页')">插入图表</button><button class="btn secondary" onclick="cwApply('已忽略建议')">忽略</button></div></div><div class="cw-ai-item"><b>资料版本更新</b><p>教材第 8 页存在新版图示，建议查看差异。</p><div class="cw-ai-actions"><button class="btn secondary" onclick="cwApply('已打开资料差异')">查看差异</button></div></div></section><section class="cw-panel"><h3>页面版本</h3><div class="cw-version"><div><b>当前草稿</b><small>教师修改 · 2 分钟前</small></div><span class="tag ok">当前</span></div><div class="cw-version"><div><b>AI 初稿</b><small>生成于今天 09:42</small></div><button class="icon-btn" onclick="cwApply('已恢复 AI 初稿')">↶</button></div></section></aside></div>`}
